  "releaseNotes": "FIXED\n\t\t\t* The specification is written beside the spec project's own project file even when the build put the binaries outside the tree.\n\t\t\t* Regenerated _specification files keep the line endings they already have\n\t\t\t* An expression naming a verbatim identifier (@lock) renders without '@', instead of falling back to its raw source\n\t\t\tCHANGED\n\t\t\t* A run that cannot locate the spec project directory no longer fails the tests; nothing is written and the reason is printed.",
